  "id": "negativity-bias",
  "term": "negativity bias",
  "definition": "Negativity bias is the tendency for negative events or information to stand out more and capture attention more strongly than neutral or positive material. People with a stronger negativity bias also tend to react more intensely and form more negative responses to negative input.",
